{"name":"Morningstar Hollows","status":"ok","title":"Morningstar Hollows","pageId":4411,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Morningstar_Hollows\" title=\"Category:Maps of Morningstar Hollows\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Morningstar Hollows</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Abandoned village</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Turmish\" title=\"Turmish\">Turmish</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Vilhon_Reach\" title=\"Vilhon Reach\">Vilhon Reach</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lizardfolk\" title=\"Lizardfolk\">Lizardfolk</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Morningstar Hollows</b> once was a small fishing village, abandoned due to the continual flooding of the <a href=\"/wiki/Alaoreum_River\" title=\"Alaoreum River\">Alaoreum River</a>. The boggy village bacame home to a tribe of <a href=\"/wiki/Lizardfolk\" title=\"Lizardfolk\">lizardfolk</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-VR-36_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VR-36-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-RT_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-RT-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Morningstar_Hollows?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After the village was swallowed by Alaoreum River's bogs, the nature flourished growing huge <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUml2ZXJfcGluZT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"River pine (page does not exist)\">river pines</span>, <a href=\"/wiki/Oak\" title=\"Oak\">oaks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Elm\" title=\"Elm\">elms</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Walnut\" title=\"Walnut\">walnut</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Pecan\" title=\"Pecan\">pecan</a> trees.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-JoT-ch9_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-JoT-ch9-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Morningstar_Hollows?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The lizardfolk of Morningstar Hollows survived by fishing and hunting.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-RT_2-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-RT-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Morningstar_Hollows?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The flooding of the Alaoreum River took several seasons. After inhabitants of Morningstar Hollows moved to nearby <a href=\"/wiki/Velorn%27s_Valor\" title=\"Velorn's Valor\">Velorn's Valor</a>, the abandoned village was taken over by bogs and swamps. By the late 14<sup>th</sup> century <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/DR\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>, the village was believed to be inhabited by a three dozen lizardfolk.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-VR-36_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VR-36-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-RT_2-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-RT-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>In the <a href=\"/wiki/1370_DR\" title=\"1370 DR\">Year of the Tankard, 1370 DR</a>, the Morningstar Hollows were taken by the <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">undead</a> armies of <a href=\"/wiki/Mohrg\" title=\"Mohrg\">mohrg</a> <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQm9ycmFuX0tsb3NrP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Borran Klosk (page does not exist)\">Borran Klosk</span> of Turmish. The undead warlord used his <a href=\"/wiki/Necromancy\" title=\"Necromancy\">necromancy</a> to fill his army with long dead folk, murdered by the <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Enclave\" title=\"Emerald Enclave\">Emerald Enclave</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-JoT-ch16_4-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-JoT-ch16-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">Year of the Ageless One, 1479 DR</a>, the lizardfolk of Morningstar Hollows was gone, driven away by a slew of adventurers seaking fame and fortune. The lizardfolk moved on to the <a href=\"/wiki/Wetwoods\" title=\"Wetwoods\">Wetwoods</a> while a gang of bandits took over the village, ambushing scar pilgrims.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-4e_5-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4e-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Morningstar_Hollows?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Morningstar_Hollows?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>Novels</dt>\n<dd><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Jewel_of_Turmish\" title=\"The Jewel of Turmish\">The Jewel of Turmish</a></i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Morningstar_Hollows?veaction=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-VR-36-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-VR-36_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-VR-36_1-1\">1.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jim_Butler\" title=\"Jim Butler\">Jim Butler</a> (1996). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Vilhon_Reach_(sourcebook)\" title=\"The Vilhon Reach (sourcebook)\">The Vilhon Reach</a> (Dungeon Master's Guide)</i>. (<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 36. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-0400-3\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-0400-3\">0-7869-0400-3</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-RT-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-RT_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-RT_2-1\">2.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-RT_2-2\">2.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rand_Sharpsword\" title=\"Rand Sharpsword\">Rand Sharpsword</a> (May 2002). <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20150920080948/http://archive.wizards.com/dnd/article.asp?x=fr/fx20020508rt\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">More of the Vilhon Reach!</a> (HTML). <a href=\"/wiki/Rand%27s_Travelogue\" title=\"Rand's Travelogue\">Rand's Travelogue</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>. Archived from <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://archive.wizards.com/dnd/article.asp?x=fr/fx20020508rt\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">the original</a> on 2015-09-20. Retrieved on 2012-03-10.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-JoT-ch9-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-JoT-ch9_3-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mel_Odom\" title=\"Mel Odom\">Mel Odom</a> (2002). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Jewel_of_Turmish\" title=\"The Jewel of Turmish\">The Jewel of Turmish</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), chap. 9. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-2698-8\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-2698-8\">0-7869-2698-8</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-JoT-ch16-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-JoT-ch16_4-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mel_Odom\" title=\"Mel Odom\">Mel Odom</a> (2002). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Jewel_of_Turmish\" title=\"The Jewel of Turmish\">The Jewel of Turmish</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), chap. 16. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-2698-8\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-2698-8\">0-7869-2698-8</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-4e-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-4e_5-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bruce_R._Cordell\" title=\"Bruce R. Cordell\">Bruce R. Cordell</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Chris_Sims\" title=\"Chris Sims\">Chris Sims</a> (August 2008). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Forgotten Realms Campaign Guide\">Forgotten Realms Campaign Guide</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Jennifer_Clarke_Wilkes\" title=\"Jennifer Clarke Wilkes\">Jennifer Clarke Wilkes</a>, <i>et al</i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 185. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4924-3\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4924-3\">978-0-7869-4924-3</a>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260516230502\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.097 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.134 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1414/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6220/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3223/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 14/100\nExpensive parser function count